{
  "$schema": "palette.schema.json",
  "$comment": "Vitesse Dark. Source: https://github.com/antfu/vscode-theme-vitesse. Licence: MIT. green is accent, link and success alike (as the theme's own button/link); purple/pink = magenta; borders and inset are derived greys (upstream #191919 is invisible).",
